Usage: clickapp [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

  A small click application.

Options:
  -o, --output PATH            Where to write results.
  --color [always|never|auto]  Colorize output.
  -v, --verbose                Print more.
  --version                    Show the version and exit.
  --help                       Show this message and exit.

Commands:
  build      Compile the project.
  run        Run the compiled program.
  self-test  Check the installation.
